        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-4162137458@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-719c902ffc@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Sep 27 2022 15:39:43 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Mill+</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">More bone yield*</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>99x faster than manual milling (14 minute savings)<sup>2</sup></li>\n<li>140% increase in catch tray volume captures up to 120cc per milling, enhancing efficiency<sup>3</sup></li>\n<li>Catch tray sits flat on surfaces for mixing<sup>3</sup></li>\n<li>Transparent hopper to load/view bone; also removable to safely collect residual bone<sup>2,3</sup></li>\n<li>Award-winning, single-pass cutting action generates consistently uniform particulate size while protecting bone from heat<sup>1</sup></li>\n<li>Refined plunger design for enhanced functionality</li>\n<li>Helps maximize harvest of autograft bone from same surgical site to potentially reduce supplements and their related costs<sup>2,3</sup></li>\n</ul>\n<p>*Due to greater access to residual bone and larger catch tray volume<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Feb 29 2024 16:23:34 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
